function v26save($cat,$ctx,$prefix,$d,$lang){$q=(object)['qtype'=>'multichoice','category'=>"$cat,$ctx"];$a=$f=$r=[];foreach($d['c'] as $i=>[$t,$w]){$a[]=['text'=>$t,'format'=>FORMAT_PLAIN];$f[]=['text'=>'<p>'.s($w).'</p>','format'=>FORMAT_HTML];$r[]=$i===$d['ok']?1.0:0.0;}$form=(object)['name'=>$prefix.$d['id'],'category'=>"$cat,$ctx",'questiontext'=>['text'=>$d['p'],'format'=>FORMAT_HTML],'generalfeedback'=>['text'=>'<p><strong>'.($lang==='ja'?'学習ポイント：':'Learning point:').'</strong> '.s($d['e']).'</p>','format'=>FORMAT_HTML],'defaultmark'=>10,'penalty'=>.3333333,'status'=>question_version_status::QUESTION_STATUS_READY,'idnumber'=>null,'single'=>1,'shuffleanswers'=>1,'answernumbering'=>'abc','showstandardinstruction'=>1,'correctfeedback'=>['text'=>$lang==='ja'?'<p>正解です。図の選択、数値、範囲、限界を結び付けましょう。</p>':'<p>Correct. Connect chart choice, numbers, scope, and limitation.</p>','format'=>FORMAT_HTML],'partiallycorrectfeedback'=>['text'=>'','format'=>FORMAT_HTML],'incorrectfeedback'=>['text'=>$lang==='ja'?'<p>問い、描画する一行の意味、軸と分母を確認して再挑戦しましょう。</p>':'<p>Check the question, plotted grain, axes, and denominator, then retry.</p>','format'=>FORMAT_HTML],'shownumcorrect'=>0,'answer'=>$a,'fraction'=>$r,'feedback'=>$f,'hint'=>[]];return question_bank::get_qtype('multichoice')->save_question($q,$form);}
